  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building grassroot women participation in budget making processes for essential</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowered citizens particularly women, youth and marginalised groups influencing government decision&#x2013;making processes with evidence on tax policy, development plans, revenue management and budgets for the delivery of public services, and  hold duty bearers and service providers to account for cost -effective and equitable delivery of those services.</narrative>
  </description>
